# Flash Decks - Cursor Rules

## Development Guidelines
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs
- Tests-first: write/adjust tests before/with implementation
- No new dependencies or public API changes without explicit line in the PRD or this prompt
- Ask at most 3 clarifiers if needed; don't block progress

## Tech Stack
- Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript
- `@vercel/postgres` + `vitest` (only approved new deps)
- No UI libraries beyond basic CSS modules

## Authentication
- Single password via env `APP_PASSWORD`
- Sign cookies using HMAC with `APP_SECRET`
- No third-party auth
- Server actions only for sensitive operations
- httpOnly, Secure cookies

## Data Model
- `decks(id, key, name)` - fixed 3 decks: patrol, ec, bdoc
- `cards(id, deck_key, question, answer, created_at, updated_at, deleted_at null)`
- Soft delete reserved for future use

## Accessibility
- Buttons properly labeled
- Form fields associated with labels
- Keyboard navigation support
- Focus management

## Security
- Server-side password comparison only
- Signed session cookies
- Input validation and sanitization
- SQL injection prevention via parameterized queries
